Manual removal for Claude Code
  File:  /home/jane/.claude/settings.json (read-only file system)
  Do:    replace it with the prepared file, or make the changes below
  /home/jane/.preloop/manual-setup/claude-code-000000000000-offboard/settings.json
  Remove these keys: env.ANTHROPIC_API_KEY, env.ANTHROPIC_CUSTOM_MODEL_OPTION,
    env.ANTHROPIC_CUSTOM_MODEL_OPTION_NAME, servers
  Set these keys (to what they were before Preloop):

{
  "env": {
    "ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL": "https://provider.example.com"
  },
  "model": "claude-sonnet-4-5"
}
